{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"defb203634c3af86bf921d8c024a253926a82eb8605cd18cff51999314c25816","ja":"翼のモテるギャップ？","zh":"翼的受欢迎反差？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1e9b876874c0ef4a9c34d6184a40fc71f88f634bba382eae0d2e3903182f75b8","ja":"ここなら、何かヒントが見つかるかもって\n思ったんだけど、どう？","zh":"我还以为在这里的话，说不定能找到什么提示呢，\n你觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3edc973c6f7a7bfa3e811703b30b2a5062df0d25da0fe45aeaaf3b232d07e48a","ja":"例えば、翼が難しい本を読んでたら、いつもの\n感じとちがって、ギャップになりそうじゃない？","zh":"比如，要是翼在读很难懂的书，不就和\n平时感觉不一样，会形成一种反差萌吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7671723d5a896480cdcda8b3f54574e742debd17ce4ae9f75b6df34f10559554","ja":"だったら～……この小説がいいかも！\nあらすじをPOPでまとめてくれてるし。えーと……。","zh":"要是那样的话～……这本小说也许不错！\n而且POP广告上也整理出了剧情简介。我看看……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"51c53fba00fae0745a9940637e82e49585f847fe1dff661e4864134582b7e594","ja":"（猫と旅に出る話……？　面白そうかも……）","zh":"（和猫一起踏上旅途的故事……？好像挺有趣的……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5b43f9c257430ada6a57ca1bff3b1013a98699cdf7f81495a2dd4c0749e26dc6","ja":"無理！　よくわかんない～！","zh":"不行！搞不懂啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"21496428b7a48f8478a71da2ea3d2555e5bddbe7d37f68cd6c094c736007bded","ja":"あらすじだけで！？","zh":"光凭梗概就！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d4d927a5e9de84395abae268d33139daed0a38d21617ad4547ed81e25e56ebe9","ja":"うん。難しい小説って、やっぱりわたしには無理かも。","zh":"嗯。难度高的小说，果然还是不太适合我吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5eb2f4ceac3993b508734f96a92d565171b27ea54c995eb029ee21f758b2af2f","ja":"あ、気分転換に絵本コーナーに行こっ♪\n絵本ってかわいいよね～♪","zh":"啊，去绘本区转换一下心情吧♪\n绘本好可爱呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"846bffb4ac9fba0a58fdb5aa1f389a9df9e3919687ddeaa90b75d71a7288371e","ja":"……待って。それは違うわ。絵本って一口に言っても\nジャンルは本当にいろいろあるのよ。","zh":"……等等。不是那样的。绘本虽然说起来简单，\n但种类真的有很多哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"356cfd6075d040034cad907ee8a3123fe5d7d3b45b556a3913dca6530c9099c3","ja":"かわいいだけものじゃなくて、ダークなものだって\nあるんだから。絵本にもギャップが……あっ！","zh":"不只是可爱的，也有黑暗的东西。绘本里也有反差……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"eda06e41bc24cbf9014feecfaffeaf84d73e57f1d9f33fe80fbddb27dbe4e463","ja":"……私達も、アイドルのお仕事で\nいろんなジャンルに挑戦してるわよね？","zh":"……我们也作为偶像，在工作中挑战各种不同的类型吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"058699d042de213ae5e0599a4b347acaccb0ac6d0cde04c2cadfb213edbc68a7","ja":"え？　うん。かわいい系とかキレイ系はもちろんだけど\nそれ以外も……この間だってプロレスコラボだったし！","zh":"诶？嗯。可爱系和漂亮系当然有，但\n其他类型也……前阵子不是","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3869c80fcb0bd1ca4c8b7bd27c598fa6fbf6555b56f52043d5c605a8d39c89dc","ja":"ええ。だからギャップなら……これまでの\nお仕事で、しっかり見せてきたんじゃない？","zh":"是啊。所以要说反差……至今为止的\n工作中，不是已经好好展现出来了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ae718903d5dc2defc92311e82b245a57012e83c52b730090ed000e9f47155d73","ja":"あっ！　そっか～。それなら\n無理にギャップを作らなくたっていいんだねっ！","zh":"啊！原来如此～。既然这样\n不用勉强制造反差也可以呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1764.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d67ea60140febd6563389341f95c2b3eee6bb30776ac37c59a1ee7cb84f53036","ja":"……って！　それじゃあどうして\nわたし、モテモテじゃないの～！？","zh":"……等等！那为什么\n我一点都不受欢迎啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
